# Pair Correlation Skill

When the user asks about 相关性 / 对冲比例 / 配对交易 / 价差 between two symbols (or "do X and Y move together"), use the local skill package.

Preferred local project path:

```text
.cursor/skills/pair-correlation
```

Workflow:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/pair-correlation/SKILL.md` and follow its spec exactly.
2. Run `scripts/pair_correlation.py` with the two requested tickers; never fabricate prices — the script pulls closes from `panda_data` / `tqx_data` and inner-joins the legs on shared trading dates.
3. Load files under `references/` only when the case needs those details.
4. Verify the reported correlation, hedge beta, and spread z-score against the aligned sample before presenting them.
5. Reproduce the disclaimer from `README.md` (Disclaimer / 免责声明) verbatim; never promise returns and never call a pair/hedge setup a trade recommendation.
